## Title: Connoisseur & Restocker
## Notes: Macros that automatically use your best food, buff food, water, potions, healthstones, bandages, and scrolls, plus a Restock List that keeps your bags full and upgrades your consumables as you level. Quality of life automation, peak performance.
## Author: Gogo1951

## IconTexture: Interface/AddOns/Consumable-Connoisseur/Includes/Images/Connoisseur.tga
